ces to be on the left side so when  you bring these two pieces back down it  will meet up so now we have the green  now what we want to do opposite the red  goes the purple in my case you might  have orange so if I want to join these  together what I have to do is again put  them in the same plane  and then when I bring these up to meet  with those I kick them out turn the top  180 degrees and then I bring the right  back down so now as you'll see if you  had something similar to mine that you  should have all the Centers should be  solved this is pretty intuitive so  you're going to have to play around with  it a little bit if you didn't get a case  that's very similar to mine but those  are the basic cases that you're going to  be getting the the L with the one piece  or basically just two of those 2x1  blocks that you'll have to join together  so the next next step we're going to be  solving these edges we're going to be  pairing them up

